WEBVTT

00:02:58.625 --> 00:03:01.083
već i sami prizor smrti naših bližnjih.

00:03:02.208 --> 00:03:04.059
Zabranili smo.

00:03:04.083 --> 00:03:06.476
Da li da uradimo jedan test?

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:09.393
Možete li da uzmete prste vaše desne ruke?

00:03:09.417 --> 00:03:11.934
Da, vi, svi,

00:03:11.958 --> 00:03:17.059
i izbrojte koliko ste leševa
videli, dotakli,

00:03:17.083 --> 00:03:20.250
poljubili i zagrlili u čitavom životu?

00:03:21.125 --> 00:03:22.518
Jedan?

00:03:22.542 --> 00:03:24.059
Ili dva?

00:03:24.083 --> 00:03:25.333
Ili nijedan?

00:03:26.042 --> 00:03:30.809
Da li će nabrajanje leševa
stići do vaše leve ruke?